[0.68973, "o", "\r\n── S4 answer — expert run with a scripted mock LLM\r\n   look at: board section writes (:result), and citation :block-id metadata from the fixture\r\n\r\n── Ingesting fixtures/sample.html (extract → block-tree-chunker → memory store)\r\n"]
