[0.704902, "o", "Building MAKE-CITING-LLM from those block ids, then RUN-EXPERT\r\n"]
[0.810057, "o", "   expert: \"cl-dev\"\r\n\r\n── Board section writes after RUN-EXPERT\r\n   look at: keys on the board plus the :RESULT value\r\n   section keys: (:PROMPT :RESULT)\r\n   PROMPT: \"cite the fixture\"\r\n   RESULT: \"echo: cite the fixture\"\r\n\r\n── Citations (block-id metadata)\r\n   raw citations: ((:BLOCK-ID\r\n                    \"07a0fdebef7f437ff1ae2863012aa359c6b8e05e229638c3fec8c2aa71ba03f2\")\r\n                   (:BLOCK-ID\r\n                    \"d316ef6bf81a6a586efbb6b094b9f5e9d5f2fa2c62817bf88932c4a08b97e4fc\"))\r\n   citation block-ids: (\"07a0fdebef7f437ff1ae2863012aa359c6b8e05e229638c3fec8c2aa71ba03f2\"\r\n                        \"d316ef6bf81a6a586efbb6b094b9f5e9d5f2fa2c62817bf88932c4a08b97e4fc\")\r\n\r\n── S4 done. Reviewer: :RESULT written; citations carry :BLOCK-ID when present.\r\n"]
